  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the Wi-Fi operating modes to which a channel applies.</summary>
    <remarks><see cref="P:Android.Net.Wifi.WifiAvailableChannel.OperationalModes" /> stores a bit mask of these modes. The channel queries <see cref="M:Android.Net.Wifi.WifiManager.GetAllowedChannels(Android.Net.Wifi.WifiBand,Android.Net.Wifi.WifiAvailableChannelModes)" /> and <see cref="M:Android.Net.Wifi.WifiManager.GetUsableChannels(Android.Net.Wifi.WifiBand,Android.Net.Wifi.WifiAvailableChannelModes)" /> accept the same mode mask.</remarks>
  </Docs>
